              "fill": "#A3A3A0",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "It opens for a moment when you press the key to confirm the app, Polish style, mic and engine, then shrinks to a compact island while you talk. Every change is one interruptible spring — dot, island, card and back — so it never jumps.",
