              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "spring bounce 0.2 · response 0.42 s · start card holds 1.2 s then collapses · level attack 30 ms / release 180 ms, peak holds 300 ms · hover opens the controls · reduced motion: cross-fade only",
